---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ProductPath from '../components/ProductPath.astro';
import { SYSTEM_PHASES, SYSTEM_PRODUCT } from '../data/start-here-system';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Start Here System"
	description="Yeh Bro’s free natural transformation system — phased blueprint, training templates, weekly checklists, and Food OS calorie setup."
	fullBleed
	canonicalPath="/start-here"
>
	<section class="sys-hero">
		<div class="sys-hero-atmosphere" aria-hidden="true"></div>
		<div class="wrap sys-hero-inner">
			<p class="eyebrow anim-rise">Free coach-grade system</p>
			<h1 class="anim-rise">
				<span class="brand-hero">YEH BRO</span>
			</h1>
			<p class="sys-product-name anim-rise-delay">{SYSTEM_PRODUCT.name}</p>
			<p class="lede anim-rise-delay">
				{SYSTEM_PRODUCT.oneLiner} Do the natural path first. Deeper culture / PED literacy waits
				until the basics feel boring in a good way.
			</p>
			<div class="cta-row anim-rise-delay-2">
				<a class="btn btn-primary" href="#phases">Enter the system</a>
				<a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/food-os">Open Food OS</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<ProductPath
		crumbs={[
			{ href: '/start-here', label: 'Start Here System', current: true },
			{ href: '/start-here/training', label: 'Training' },
			{ href: '/start-here/weekly', label: 'Weekly' },
			{ href: '/food-os', label: 'Food OS' },
		]}
	/>

	<section class="section wrap" id="phases">
		<p class="eyebrow">The natural path</p>
		<h2>Five phases. One job each.</h2>
		<p class="lede sys-lede">
			Not an eight-week cosplay timeline — a repeatable process that still holds in twelve months.
			Week ranges overlap on purpose: food and recovery run beside training, not after it.
		</p>

		<ol class="phase-rail">
			{
				SYSTEM_PHASES.map((phase) => (
					<li class="phase-item" id={`phase-${phase.id}`}>
						<div class="phase-meta">
							<span class="phase-num">{String(phase.number).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
							<span class="phase-weeks">{phase.weeks}</span>
						</div>
						<h3>{phase.name}</h3>
						<p class="phase-job">{phase.job}</p>
						<ul class="phase-focus">
							{phase.focus.map((f) => (
								<li>{f}</li>
							))}
						</ul>
						<p class="phase-done">
							<strong>Done when:</strong> {phase.doneWhen}
						</p>
						<a class="phase-link" href={phase.href}>
							{phase.id === 'food'
								? 'Open Food OS →'
								: phase.id === 'consistency' || phase.id === 'overload'
									? 'Training templates →'
									: phase.id === 'recovery'
										? 'Weekly checklist →'
										: 'Stay on this page →'}
						</a>
					</li>
				))
			}
		</ol>
	</section>

	<section class="section-tight wrap tools-strip">
		<p class="eyebrow">System tools</p>
		<h2>Use these — don’t just read them.</h2>
		<ul class="tool-links">
			<li>
				<a href="/start-here/training">
					Training templates
					<span>Full body 3× and Upper/Lower 4× with sets, reps, and progression rules.</span>
				</a>
			</li>
			<li>
				<a href="/start-here/weekly">
					Weekly checklist
					<span>Training, steps, sleep, weigh-ins — sticky in your browser.</span>
				</a>
			</li>
			<li>
				<a href="/food-os">
					Food OS
					<span>Cut / maintain / lean bulk calories + macros with plain-English why.</span>
				</a>
			</li>
			<li>
				<a href="/food">
					Food hub
					<span>Protein, cutting, lean bulk guides around the calculator.</span>
				</a>
			</li>
		</ul>
	</section>

	<section class="section wrap" id="supplements">
		<p class="eyebrow">Phase add-ons</p>
		<h2>Supplements that actually matter</h2>
		<p class="lede sys-lede">
			Most tubs are noise. For the natural path, the short list is boring on purpose — after food and
			training are moving.
		</p>
		<ul class="plain-list">
			<li>
				<strong>Creatine monohydrate</strong> — 3–5 g daily. Loading optional.
				<a href="/blog/best-creatine-australia">Creatine guide</a>
				·
				<a href="/go/creatine-true" rel="sponsored noopener noreferrer">True Protein creatine</a>
				·
				<a href="/go/creatine-bulk" rel="sponsored noopener noreferrer">Bulk Nutrients creatine</a>
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Protein powder</strong> — only if food undershoots. Judge cost per ~25 g protein.
				<a href="/blog/best-protein-powder-australia">Protein guide</a>
				·
				<a href="/go/protein-true" rel="sponsored noopener noreferrer">True Protein whey</a>
				·
				<a href="/go/protein-bulk" rel="sponsored noopener noreferrer">Bulk Nutrients protein</a>
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Caffeine</strong> — useful for training focus if you tolerate it. Not a personality.
				<a href="/blog/caffeine-dose-training">Caffeine timing</a>
			</li>
		</ul>
		<p class="muted">
			Order of operations:
			<a href="/blog/beginner-supplement-stack-australia">Beginner stack</a>
			·
			<a href="/blog/yeh-bro-current-picks">Current picks</a>
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="section-tight wrap later-gate" id="later">
		<p class="eyebrow">Later — not day one</p>
		<h2>Deeper culture when the basics are locked</h2>
		<p class="lede sys-lede">
			Gym culture has a pharmacology shadow. Ignoring it creates naivety; leading with it creates
			chaos for beginners. Soft gate: train consistently first. Then literacy — risks, bloodwork,
			legality — not a shopping list. We don’t source gear.
		</p>
		<div class="cta-row">
			<a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/blog/bodybuilding-culture-education">Culture education</a>
			<a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/blog/ped-harm-reduction-australia">PED harm reduction</a>
			<a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/blog/bloodwork-for-lifters">Bloodwork for lifters</a>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section wrap close-sys">
		<p class="eyebrow">This week</p>
		<h2>Your first seven days</h2>
		<ol class="week-one">
			<li>Open <a href="/start-here/training">training templates</a> and book 3–4 sessions.</li>
			<li>Set calories in <a href="/food-os">Food OS</a> — maintain first if you’re unsure.</li>
			<li>Run the <a href="/start-here/weekly">weekly checklist</a> like it’s part of the program.</li>
			<li>Protect one sleep window. Start creatine if you want the easy win (3–5 g/day).</li>
		</ol>
		<div class="cta-row">
			<a class="btn btn-primary" href="/start-here/training">Start with training</a>
			<a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/food-os">Set up Food OS</a>
		</div>
		<p class="compliance muted">
			Education only — not medical advice. Individual needs vary. Talk to a clinician for personal
			health decisions.
		</p>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.sys-hero {
		position: relative;
		min-height: min(88vh, 760px);
		display: flex;
		align-items: flex-end;
		padding: 5.5rem 0 3.5rem;
		overflow: hidden;
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(242, 242, 240, 0.08);
	}
	.sys-hero-atmosphere {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		background:
			linear-gradient(115deg, rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.2), rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.92)),
			repeating-linear-gradient(
				90deg,
				rgba(242, 242, 240, 0.028) 0,
				rgba(242, 242, 240, 0.028) 1px,
				transparent 1px,
				transparent 68px
			),
			repeating-linear-gradient(
				0deg,
				rgba(242, 242, 240, 0.028) 0,
				rgba(242, 242, 240, 0.028) 1px,
				transparent 1px,
				transparent 68px
			),
			radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 50% at 82% 28%, rgba(200, 241, 53, 0.2), transparent 55%),
			radial-gradient(ellipse 45% 40% at 12% 75%, rgba(46, 230, 166, 0.1), transparent 50%);
		pointer-events: none;
		animation: hero-atmosphere 14s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
	}
	.sys-hero-inner {
		position: relative;
		z-index: 1;
	}
	.brand-hero {
		display: inline-block;
		position: relative;
	}
	.brand-hero::after {
		content: '';
		display: block;
		height: 6px;
		width: 100%;
		margin-top: 0.35rem;
		background: var(--yb-lime);
		transform-origin: left;
		animation: underline-grow 0.8s ease 0.35s both;
	}
	.sys-product-name {
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 3.2vw, 2rem);
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.04em;
		color: var(--yb-teal);
		margin: 0.85rem 0 1rem;
	}
	.sys-lede {
		max-width: 40rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
	}
	.phase-rail {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
		margin: 0;
		display: grid;
		gap: 1.75rem;
	}
	.phase-item {
		margin: 0;
		padding: 1.35rem 0 0;
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(242, 242, 240, 0.12);
		scroll-margin-top: 7.5rem;
		animation: rise-in 0.65s ease both;
	}
	.phase-item:nth-child(2) {
		animation-delay: 0.05s;
	}
	.phase-item:nth-child(3) {
		animation-delay: 0.1s;
	}
	.phase-item:nth-child(4) {
		animation-delay: 0.15s;
	}
	.phase-item:nth-child(5) {
		animation-delay: 0.2s;
	}
	.phase-meta {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
		align-items: baseline;
		margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
	}
	.phase-num {
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
		color: var(--yb-lime);
	}
	.phase-weeks {
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		letter-spacing: 0.06em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--yb-muted);
	}
	.phase-item h3 {
		margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
	}
	.phase-job {
		color: rgba(242, 242, 240, 0.88);
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
		max-width: 40rem;
	}
	.phase-focus {
		max-width: 42rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
	}
	.phase-done {
		margin: 0 0 0.85rem;
		padding-left: 0.85rem;
		border-left: 3px solid var(--yb-lime);
		max-width: 40rem;
		color: rgba(242, 242, 240, 0.9);
	}
	.phase-link {
		font-weight: 700;
		text-decoration: none;
		letter-spacing: 0.02em;
	}
	.phase-link:hover {
		color: var(--yb-teal);
	}
	.tools-strip {
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(242, 242, 240, 0.1);
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(242, 242, 240, 0.1);
	}
	.tool-links {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
		margin: 1.5rem 0 0;
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.35rem;
	}
	.tool-links a {
		display: block;
		padding: 1.1rem 0;
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(242, 242, 240, 0.12);
		text-decoration: none;
		color: var(--yb-offwhite);
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2.5vw, 1.55rem);
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.03em;
		transition:
			color 0.2s ease,
			padding-left 0.2s ease;
	}
	.tool-links a:hover {
		color: var(--yb-lime);
		padding-left: 0.35rem;
	}
	.tool-links span {
		display: block;
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		font-weight: 400;
		text-transform: none;
		letter-spacing: 0;
		color: var(--yb-muted);
		margin-top: 0.3rem;
	}
	.plain-list {
		max-width: 42rem;
	}
	.later-gate {
		background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.5), transparent);
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(242, 242, 240, 0.08);
		padding-left: 0;
		padding-right: 0;
	}
	.week-one {
		max-width: 40rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}
	.compliance {
		margin-top: 2rem;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		max-width: 36rem;
	}
	@keyframes hero-atmosphere {
		from {
			filter: brightness(1);
			transform: scale(1);
		}
		to {
			filter: brightness(1.06);
			transform: scale(1.02);
		}
	}
	@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
		.sys-hero-atmosphere,
		.phase-item {
			animation: none;
		}
	}
</style>
